---
// Contact.astro
---

<section class="w-full py-20 bg-zinc-950 border-t border-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-2">Canales de enlace</h2>
            <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white italic uppercase">Conéctame<span class="text-amber-400">_</span></h3>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
            
            <!-- Formulario Estético con Campos Opcionales -->
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <label class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase ml-2">Nombre</label>
                        <input type="text" placeholder="Andrés" class="w-full bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-amber-400/30 transition-all font-mono text-sm" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <label class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase ml-2">Asunto</label>
                        <input type="text" placeholder="Colaboración" class="w-full bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-amber-400/30 transition-all font-mono text-sm" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Campos Opcionales -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <label class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase ml-2 flex justify-between">
                            Correo <span class="text-slate-700 italic">Opcional</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="email" placeholder="user@example.com" class="w-full bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-amber-400/30 transition-all font-mono text-sm" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <label class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase ml-2 flex justify-between">
                            Teléfono <span class="text-slate-700 italic">Opcional</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="tel" placeholder="+57 300..." class="w-full bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-amber-400/30 transition-all font-mono text-sm" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <label class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase ml-2">Mensaje</label>
                    <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Escribe tu mensaje aquí..." class="w-full bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-amber-400/30 transition-all font-mono text-sm resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>

                <button class="w-full py-4 bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/20 rounded-xl text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-amber-400 hover:text-black transition-all duration-500 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(251,191,36,0.05)]">
                    Enviar Transmisión
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Columna de Redes (Derecha) -->
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
                        ¿Tienes alguna pregunta o quieres colaborar en un proyecto? Aunque este formulario es estético, puedes encontrarme activamente en mis plataformas digitales.
                    </p>

                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <a href="https://github.com/Andresnan21" target="_blank" class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl group hover:border-amber-400/40 transition-all">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                                <span class="text-amber-400 bg-amber-400/10 p-2 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs">GH</span>
                                <span class="text-slate-200 font-mono text-sm uppercase">GitHub</span>
                            </div>
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-600 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10"/></svg>
                        </a>

                        <a href="#" class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl group hover:border-amber-400/40 transition-all">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                                <span class="text-amber-400 bg-amber-400/10 p-2 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs">LN</span>
                                <span class="text-slate-200 font-mono text-sm uppercase">LinkedIn</span>
                            </div>
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-600 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7v10"/></svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Footer sutil -->
                <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-900/50">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest">
                        Core-Mind // 2026 // v1.0.4
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>